      "created_at": "2016-02-12T20:39:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fugue State is slightly too hard to read. Especially the word&nbsp;State where the washed out letters behind it blend too easily&nbsp;between the letters in the foreground.&nbsp;Other than that it looks pretty great.</p><p>One thing I would do though is instead of having that floating code behind the PARSE text, to instead incorrporate it inside the PARSE letters. That might look pretty good.</p>",
