      "id": 162002,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-13T02:46:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"deddragon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/48/2335_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> deddragon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I love it!!<br>Except for the floating background code. That seems like too much code on the card, just my opinion. But her name, and the words Fugue State look perfect!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I could easily be convinced that the background code is too much. It might not make it to the final version.</p>\n<p>The next two on my list aren't ones I think are broken per se, but I've got some ideas for how I'd like to change them. We'll see if I can find time to work on them later in the weekend.&nbsp;</p>",
