      "raw": "[quote=\"deddragon\"]\n\nI love it!!<br />Except for the floating background code. That seems like too much code on the card, just my opinion. But her name, and the words Fugue State look perfect!\n\n[/quote]\n\nI could easily be convinced that the background code is too much. It might not make it to the final version.\n\nThe next two on my list aren&#39;t ones I think are broken per se, but I&#39;ve got some ideas for how I&#39;d like to change them. We&#39;ll see if I can find time to work on them later in the weekend.&nbsp;\n",
