    {
      "id": 162003,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-13T03:22:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I like it, although I do think that the backround code is too much. &nbsp;The problem, in my mind is that there's three different sets of overlayed text - the background code, the equations in the air, and the background \"fugue state\". &nbsp;Having all three feels redundant to me, especially since the background code and the fugue state text overlap.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm not entirely happy with the picture itself either, but that's not something that's easy to fix. &nbsp;It's a lovely image, but it doesn't convey to me the urgency her bio leads me to expect. &nbsp;I think that that could be solved with either a more actiony pose or a less blank expression, but it's hard to know for certain.</p>",
