      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Belle Sorciere\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Belle Sorciere:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Eh, she's got Asperger syndrome/autism spectrum disorder. A degree of muted affect (lack of expression) is not unusual.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Especially after being BSoD'ed by OblivAeon. &nbsp;I understand. &nbsp;I just think it contributes to the lack of dynamic element in the picture. &nbsp;Maybe if she looked like she was about to throw her arrow, rather than just simply holding it?</p>",
