      "id": 162006,
      "name": "Ironic",
      "username": "Ironic",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-13T04:01:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually seeing her throw an arrow would be neat, but it's hard for me to object to a blank expression on a card which literally describes itself as a \"Fugue State\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I also really like this design - and vote against removing any background elements.&nbsp; The code and the double Fugue State really help to get across the \"too much information\" idea which underlies the character.</p>",
